  <p id="c-jinshu-064-simaquan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-064-simaquan:p001:m0000" ref="e9x_60x_9m9">銓</persName>初封上庸王，<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simaquan:p001:m0007" ref="83d_b6e_058">懷帝</persName>即位，更封豫章王。二年，立為皇太子。洛京傾覆，沒于<persName id="c-jinshu-064-simaquan:p001:m0034" ref="d96_1fa_e9a">劉聰</persName>。</p>
